Accept inline JSON string for deploy_new_asset RPC

Replace the json_filename parameter with json_string in the
deploy_new_asset RPC.
- Update the RPC request definition to accept an inline JSON string.
- Update request serialization/deserialization to use json_string.
- Parse asset metadata directly from the request body instead of reading
  it from a file.
- Fix the deploy_new_asset response serializer to return tx_key,
  tx_hex, full_name, and tx_fee.
- Simplify RPC usage by removing the dependency on a local JSON file.
